    "updated_at": "2022-06-30T09:30:50Z",
    "body": "The implementation in starship seems sound. According to the [upstream `notify-rust` docs](https://docs.rs/notify-rust/latest/notify_rust/struct.Notification.html#method.timeout), setting timeouts on macOS is not supported, and I couldn't immediately find any code handling it on macOS. Are you sure setting ` notification_timeout` to `5_000_000` has any impact?",
